{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": [
    "Buddy accessories as data. Each one is drawn from 'layers' around an 'anchor':",
    "'head' = top-centre of the head, 'eyes' = midpoint between the eyes. Units are dp.",
    "A coordinate can be a number or a sum like '-1bw+1': bw/bh = body half-width/height,",
    "ex = half the distance between the eyes, lk = where the buddy is looking (eyes follow it).",
    "Layer types: circle (x,y,r), line (x1,y1,x2,y2), rect / rrect (l,t,r,b[,radius]),",
    "arc (l,t,r,b,start,sweep), path (SVG 'd' with M L H V Q C Z, absolute or relative).",
    "Style: color '#RRGGBB' / '#AARRGGBB' / 'accent' / 'accent2'; 'stroke': width for an outline;",
    "'clip': true clips the layer to the previous path. Optional 'rotate': {deg,x,y} on the whole accessory.",
    "Unlock: 'streak' = best streak needed; 'from' = yyyy-MM-dd before which it's not shown at all.",
    "'hat': true moves the level-3 sprout aside. Order here is the order in the collection."
  ],
  "accessories": [
